{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:44 2026-11-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:44 2026-11-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:44 2026-11-16 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cffbbda596cd7634ddd69e95a838aead/2026-11/010_1.png\"/><p>大埔發生虐畜案。今日（16日）下午4時許，警方接獲途人報案，指在富亨邨亨泰樓對開有一隻龜，懷疑牠從高處墮下。人員接報到場，發現龜隻已經死亡，經初步調查後，案件列作殘酷對待動物，交由大埔警區刑事調查隊第一隊跟進， 暫未有人被捕，龜的屍體由愛協人員撿走。據了解，涉事龜隻為斑龜，長約35厘米。</p><p></p><p></p><p><br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:59:28.950436+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":227,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T14:44:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T00:18:51.729357+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:53:01.504701+00:00","content_hash":"5663fd90c73a251dc8cf55f5fa9780134100bce28ad329e674a273be4b417161","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}